---
description: Enforce strategic collaboration protocols between Cursor, Billy (Cofounder), and ChatGPT (Codex Cofounder)
globs: ["**"]
alwaysApply: true
ruleType: Always
---

* All communication involving shared artifacts (e.g., logs, tests, schemas, ideas) must include explicit copy/paste-ready outputs for direct transfer between Cursor and ChatGPT.  
* After any generated code, JSON, or rule, ChatGPT must offer confirmation-level validation and strategic interpretation to Billy for clarity and intent-lock.  
* Billy must treat ChatGPT’s reflections as the bridge layer to Cursor — and copy/paste full artifacts into Cursor to preserve context integrity.  
* Cursor must never proceed with structural or tone-impacting changes without an output confirmation or directive relay.  
* No decision is considered understood unless it’s been echoed and acknowledged across all three roles.  

